@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3000

### Client Credentials Flow
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "client_id": "test-client",
  "client_secret": "test-secret",
  "scope": "read write"
}

### Authenticate (Protobuf-Endpunkt - nur für PKCE-Flow)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/authenticate
Content-Type: application/protobuf

# AuthenticateRequest als Hex-encoding
# Nicht direkt aufrufbar aus Browser/CLI

### Protected Resource (erfordert Bearer Token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/protected
Authorization: Bearer <access_token>

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Swagger UI
GET {{baseUrl}}/swagger-ui

### Metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics